# Supabase Connection
# 1. Create a free project at https://supabase.com
# 2. Copy Project URL and Anon Key from Project Settings > API
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-ref.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-supabase-anon-key

# Note on Email & Google Auth:
# - Brevo SMTP credentials (for 300 free emails/day) are configured directly in Supabase Dashboard > Authentication > SMTP Settings.
# - Google OAuth credentials are configured in Google Cloud Console & Supabase Dashboard > Authentication > Providers > Google.
# See SUPABASE_SETUP.md for complete step-by-step instructions.
